stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Acquiring : start()
  Acquiring --> Recording : getUserMedia / getDisplayMedia OK
  Acquiring --> Error : permission denied / no codec

  Recording --> Rotating : timer fires (maxChunkSeconds)
  Rotating --> Recording : new MediaRecorder spawned
  Rotating --> Emitting : onstop fires

  Recording --> Stopping : stop()
  Stopping --> Emitting : onstop fires
  Emitting --> Uploading : onChunk(blob)
  Uploading --> Idle : POST /api/recordings OK
  Uploading --> Error : network / 5xx
  Error --> Idle : user dismisses
